{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50252","headline":"许真君铁柱 · 李翔","name":"许真君铁柱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恐老蛟重作患深[一]，独埋铁柱至如今。\n根牢直下蟠江底，势壮长留镇郡心。\n神鬼每闻趋夜後，风雷不敢犯塘阴。\n无因更走横泉窟，压断祈精气永沉。\n（[一]首句有误，疑当作「深恐老蛟重作患」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}